sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant PR as TrackControllerProcess
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as Program (vital code)
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant TM as Track Model
    loop every tick of the shared clock (fixed dt)
        H->>H: _on_tick internal: inputs_for(): ctc_to_track_controller(...), track_model_to_track_controller(...)
        H->>PR: step(tick, dt, sim_time_s, inputs) (STEP over ModuleLink)
        PR->>PR: step internal: inputs_from_wire(inputs)
        PR->>S: step(dt, inputs)
        S->>M: step(dt, inputs)
        M->>M: step internal: _validate(dt, inputs): the whole tick, or reject it unchanged
        M->>M: step internal: maintenance := a CTC command on a governed switch, _waiting_lines()
        loop each wayside
            M->>W: set_occupancy, set_closed, set_suggestion, set_ctc_switch_command, set_switch_position (from _apply)
            alt its line is not ready
                M->>W: idle(reason): transmit nothing (UC-18)
            else ready
                M->>W: scan()
                W->>W: _run internal: build_scan_inputs(), user Program.scan(image)
                W->>V: scan(image + the program's outputs)
                V-->>W: return the final OUT_ bits
                W->>W: _run internal: encode_outputs(final)
            end
        end
        M->>M: step internal: _outputs(time_s): commands (UC-13 to UC-16), _report() per wayside (UC-17)
        M-->>S: return TrackControllerOutputs
        S->>S: step internal: mark the views dirty
        S-->>PR: return the outputs
        PR->>PR: step internal: outputs_to_wire(outputs)
        PR-->>H: return the outputs (STEP reply)
        H->>H: _finish_tick internal: keep the outputs. Next tick, inputs_for() maps them: track_controller_to_track_model(...), track_controller_to_ctc(...)
        H->>TM: STEP, next tick: switches, signals, crossings, track circuits
        H->>CTC: STEP, next tick: occupancy, read-back, ready per wayside
    end
